WEBVTT

00:35:26.937 --> 00:35:30.022
but it's often easier
to teach skills than values.

00:35:30.046 --> 00:35:33.313
In Menlo's case,
one core value is collaboration.

00:35:33.337 --> 00:35:35.662
(Music)

00:35:35.686 --> 00:35:39.659
RS: We changed the interview process
to literally match the culture,

00:35:39.683 --> 00:35:43.606
and we prefer a lot
of rowers in the rowboat

00:35:43.630 --> 00:35:45.805
who are learning
how to row with each other

00:35:45.829 --> 00:35:47.993
in a way that the boat
actually stays straight

00:35:48.017 --> 00:35:50.326
down the middle of the path
that you're going on,

00:35:50.350 --> 00:35:52.287
rather than have one really strong rower

00:35:52.311 --> 00:35:54.612
that's got the whole boat
going around in circles

00:35:54.636 --> 00:35:57.359
because they're outperforming
everybody else on the team,

00:35:57.383 --> 00:35:59.394
which happens a lot in software.

00:35:59.418 --> 00:36:01.745
AG: The other core value is learning.